            <div xml:id="d686">

                <pb facs="0805" n="795" sameAs="frus:frus1948v07/pg795"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">121.67/10–148: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Kohler</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-10-01T14:00:00+03:00">October 1, 1948—2
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 1—11:08 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2204. Communication re Dairen couriers sent FonOff September 30 (reDeptel 1169,
                    September 27, repeated Nanking 1364, Shanghai 1664, Dairen 56).</p>
                <p>Department pass Nanking 35, Shanghai 33, Dairen 21.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kohler</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
